  "description": "AMUMUT crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H78 Cl4 Er8 N28 O16,2(C3 H7 N1 O1),2(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Er1 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2 (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3 (Er) has 3 O neighbors; Er4 (Er) has 3 O neighbors; Er1A (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er2A (Er) has 6 O neighbors; Er3A (Er) has 3 O neighbors; Er4A (Er) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.687-3.831 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 101.29-111.29°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C84H112Cl4Er8N30O22. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies S(I).",
